WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.439 line:72%
First, most big computer
failures happen at the handoffs

2
00:00:04.439 --> 00:00:07.416 line:72%
between teams or parts, not
inside them.

3
00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:14.467 line:72%
Second, the cause is usually a
guess nobody wrote down, like
which units a number uses.

4
00:00:14.827 --> 00:00:19.880 line:72%
Third, when every handoff guess
is written down and
machine-checked,

5
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.183 line:72%
a fix in one place stays fixed.
